#70600
"Under a Huge Tree"
"A huge tree leans across the entire path, completely blocking sight of the sky
or even the canopy.  The tree is quite healthy, however, other than some
scattered, tiny holes pecked into the bark by a hunt for insects.  Ferns and
grasses grow healthily near the ground despite the shading, and vines tangle
through a dense section of trees that the huge one merges into.
"
""
