#70601
"A Narrow Path in an Overgrown Forest"
"The forest floor here is thick with vegetation blocking anything larger than a
horse from moving through.  There is a narrow path that leads to the south and
east.  The path is almost suffocating with the closeness of the surrounding
plant life, the only escape from the everpresent green is up in the sky.  The
air around you is damp, heavy, and hot.
"
""
