#70605
"At the Base of a Massive Tree"
"A massive tree towers above the jungle floor, so wide that the armswidth of a
half dozen people could not even encircle it halfway.  Several lianas, firmly
rooted into the ground, wrap around the massive tree, like a network of
knotted ropes.  The north is blocked in an entirely different way, smaller
trees growing close together and small shrubs growing in between.
"
"Climb lianas to canopy, not so difficult, like climbing a rope ladder
Further in, the climbs become more challenging.
"
