#70609
"Surrounded by Massive Trees"
"Dense foliage is quite abundant here, massive ferns and exotic flowers fill
the gaps between the ancient trees.  To the south, you can occasionally hear
the faint sounds of a gentle stream, and it appears that the forest thins a
bit to the southwest.  The wall of plant life east of you would not yield
passage to any but the smallest of creatures.
"
""
