#70610
"A Small Section of Stream"
"A small stream winds its way between the trees, flowing further into the dense
brush to the northeast.  The reflection of the canopy above and the fallen
leaves in the gently flowing water produce a tranquil scene, that is
unfortunately disturbed every so often by the wildlife here.  The stream flows
from the southwest, though a direct route is not available to you.
"
""
