#70617
"The Jungle"
"Dense clusters of large trees form wavy patterns across the brown and green
leaf covered forest floor.  Echoes of rustling leaves and snapping of smaller
twigs and branches bounce across the jungle with every step.  Smaller plant
life such as bushes and tall purple flowers decorate the forest floor adding
some color to the ground.  Within the bushes there is near constant rustling
or whipping of the bush as if something were hiding within.  Openings within
the centers of the tree clusters allow passage to north, east, south, and the
west.
"
""
