#70619
"The Jungle"
"In the center of the forest floor three pools of muddy water has gathered, a
reminder of a past rain storm.  Drying out slowly, the pools will eventually
give way to leaves and dirt that will fill the holes left.  Surrounding the
pools are several dense clusters of large dying trees, charred and scarred
with wear and tear, not to mention victims of a bolt of lightning.  Much of
the vegetation seems cleared out, as evidence by the trees perhaps a fire
occurred here in the past.
"
""
