#70620
"Before a Giant Tree"
"Standing out from the eastern cluster of dense trees, a giant blackened tree,
like an old warrior watches over the jungle.  Thick vines, both new and old
dangle from the branches above almost reaching the ground.  Around the tree is
evidence of a past fire occurring from a single strike of lightning as
evidence by a nearby tree split down the center, revealing the light colored
wood inside.  Most of the leaf cover remains intact, revealing grasses and
plants underneath its cover.  Examining the giant tree closer, there appears
to be cut holes in the trunk big enough for hands and feet to climb upon.
"
""
