#70621
"Before a Giant Tree"
"Standing before a dense cluster of trees is a gigantic tree, far older than
many trees in the jungle.  Scratches, holes burrowed into its thick trunk, and
bits torn out of it mark its scars of time.  Overhead, the tree shadows the
ground with a thick cluster of dark green leaves and branches stretching out
into the forest ceiling.  Thick vines dangle almost to the ground, allowing
one to climb up into the tree.  A virtual impenetrable wall of trees surrounds
to the west and north, allowing only a path of green and brown leaves to the
east and south.
"
""
