#70622
"The Jungle"
"Large dark green ferns grow in dense clusters replacing most of the trees in
this area.  Purple and white flowers grow freely in the open space here, and
are provided with lots of light from a large opening in the forest ceiling. 
Small brown dirt covered rocks litter the top of the blanket of leaves
covering the forest floor, sticking out like path markers.  Dried botches of
blood appear on some of the leaves around the area.
"
