#70626
"The Jungle"
"Spots of dried blood dot the trees, ferns, and bushes as if something were
slaughtered in this area.  Only the surrounding trees know for sure.  Only if
they could speak, the stories they could tell.  Sink holes are present in the
ground as parts of the ground sinks underneath the leaves, easily causing a
foot to become lodged.  Scattered across the leaves are small pointed dirt
matted rocks that have surfaced from their cover of leaves.  The echoes of the
jungle animals seems to surround everything within.
"
""
