#70627
"The Jungle"
"Dense clusters of ancient trees narrow the vision of anyone that travels
through this area.  Smaller spaces between the trees prevent a far vision into
what is ahead.  Constant rustling sounds erupt from the blanket of brown and
green leaves covering the forest floor.  Peering down at some of the leaves,
droplets of dried blood cover some of the leaves.  A fair indication of a
jungle predator making a kill in this area.
"
""
