#70774
"Up in a Tree"
"Atop this tree, the trunk appears very uneven and keeping balance is a
challenge.  Clusters of dark green leaves mat parts of the trunk, causing
anyone to part the leaves in order to reach different areas across the trunk. 
Snaking across, a small twisted path leads across with a curtain of dangling
vines swinging back and forth.  A vine latched tightly to the trunk dangling
down allows one to climb down to the forest floor.
"
""
