#70780
"Up in a Giant Tree"
"Several holes along the massive trunk allows good holds and footing for
climbers.  Upon a u-shaped area of the trunk allows a few moments of rest
before gazing out at the long, thick branches stretching off from the trunk. 
Each branch could easily hold a humanoid being and allow them to walk across
the branch with relative ease.  Only two branches to the north and west allow
such passage while further up the trunk seems currently impossible.
"
