#70781
"A Broken Tree Branch"
"This thick tree branch seems to have broken off due to a lightning strike as
evidence of black charred marks on the end of the splintered wood.  Lying
below on the forest floor is the remains of the tree branch, charred, but now
home to small insects and tiny animals.  Thick clusters of green leaves above
shake and rattle from animals either jumping from branch to branch or pulling
on the smaller branches.  Nothing more to view here, but to turn back.
"
""
