#70783
"The Jungle Gremlin's Home"
"The end of the branch is soaked in blood with much of it drying and adding a
reddish tint to the branch.  Animal bones, mostly that of birds are scattered
across the thick flat end of the branch.  Trickling off the branch are tiny
rivers of blood from fresh bird corpses that lie torn and shredded from what
appears to be claw and bite marks.  A foul stench arises from the collection
of bird corpses made worse from the hot humid climate of the jungle.  Back
across the branch seems more pleasant.
"
"jungle gremlin would be a medium sized mob
